-dictionary</a> Table 1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Borromean</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">6^3_2</code> (<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathcal{B}_3</code>)</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(\\sigma_0\\sigma_1^{-1})^3 \\in B_3</code></td>\n<td>proton, neutron, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">^4</code>He, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\alpha</code>-scale</td>\n<td><a href=\"#prop:binding-scale-catalan\">binding-scale-catalan</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\beta</code>-decay operator</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">T_\\beta</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\sigma_0\\sigma_1^{-1} \\in H_3(q)</code></td>\n<td>weak vertex on neutron <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\to</code> proton</td>\n<td><a href=\"#cor:spectral-decomposition-qvalue\">spectral-decomposition-qvalue</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Atomic braid</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">T_w(Z,N)</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathtt{atom\\_braid\\_word\\_3A}(Z,N) \\in H_{3A}(q)</code></td>\n<td>nucleus binding</td>\n<td><a href=\"#prop:atom-knot-mass-derivation\">atom-knot-mass-derivation</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/binding-knots-visual-inventory-table1-data.md","heading":"Table"}
